\p{OpenAI. \em{The crossing number of complete bipartite graphs}. Preprint, 23 September 2026, 16 pages. [Repository directory](https://github.com/openai/math/tree/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-crossing-number-of-complete-bipartite-graphs-September-23-2026); [local PDF](/source-material/openai-math/preprints/The-crossing-number-of-complete-bipartite-graphs-September-23-2026/paper.pdf); [LaTeX entry point](/source-material/openai-math/preprints/The-crossing-number-of-complete-bipartite-graphs-September-23-2026/build/paper.tex); [original bibliography](/source-material/openai-math/preprints/The-crossing-number-of-complete-bipartite-graphs-September-23-2026/build/references.bib).}

\p{Theorem 1.1 is [the formula](cn-0007). The proof's main components are [Lemma 2.1](cn-0024), [Corollary 2.3](cn-0027), [Lemmas 3.1–3.2](cn-0060), [Lemmas 4.1–4.2](cn-0062), and [normalization in Appendix A](cn-0009). The [source record](cn-0039) identifies the archived version and local checks.}
